OpenSSL: encryption, signatures and certificates with the OpenSSL of
the base system. php82-openssl-legacy is the same module with the
legacy provider of OpenSSL; install one of the two.

The module openssl of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/openssl.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its
headers in include/php82/php/ext/openssl.
